WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.763 --> 00:00:15.432
How wonderful!

00:01:01.603 --> 00:01:03.730
I'm very sorry, Milady.

00:01:07.275 --> 00:01:09.402
Please forgive us!

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:16.451
Come on.

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:33.843
They're right at their peak.

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:36.429
Yes, they're beautiful.

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:44.646
Let's go home.

